<h2 id="a2-proof-of-lemma-41">🌿 A.2 Proof Of Lemma 4.1</h2>
<p><strong>引理 4.1：给定完整 Hessian 逆矩阵 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-89%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%22%7D"></card> 的 Cholesky 因子 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-90%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D%22%7D"></card>，Hessian 逆矩阵 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-91%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B-q%3A%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%3D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D_%7B-q%3A%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D_%7B-q%3A%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D)%5E%7B-1%7D%22%7D"></card> 等价于 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-92%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7Bq%2B1%3A%2Cq%2B1%3A%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7Bq%2B1%3A%2Cq%2B1%3A%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%7D"></card></strong></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>证明</strong>：不失一般性，首先证明 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-93%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B-1%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%3D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D_%7B-1%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D_%7B-1%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D)%5E%7B-1%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7B2%3A%2C2%3A%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7B2%3A%2C2%3A%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%7D"></card> 的情形。对 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-94%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%22%7D"></card> 进行 Cholesky 分解，有 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-95%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%7D"></card>，其中 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-96%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D%22%7D"></card> 为下三角矩阵。因此，Cholesky 因子可改写为</li>
</ul>
<p style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-97%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D%3D%5C%5Cbegin%7Bbmatrix%7DL_%7B11%7D%260%5C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7B2%3A%2C1%7D%26%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7B2%3A%2C2%3A%7D%5C%5Cend%7Bbmatrix%7D%5C%5Ctag%7BA.13%7D%22%7D"></card></p>
<ul>
<li>将上式代入 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-98%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%7D"></card>，得到</li>
</ul>
<p style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-99%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%3D%5C%5Cbegin%7Bbmatrix%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B11%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%26%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B1%2C2%3A%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B2%3A%2C1%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%26%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B2%3A%2C2%3A%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%5C%5Cend%7Bbmatrix%7D%3D%5C%5Cbegin%7Bbmatrix%7DL_%7B11%7D%260%5C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7B2%3A%2C1%7D%26%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7B2%3A%2C2%3A%7D%5C%5Cend%7Bbmatrix%7D%5C%5Cbegin%7Bbmatrix%7DL_%7B11%7D%26%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7B2%3A%2C1%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C0%26%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7B2%3A%2C2%3A%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cend%7Bbmatrix%7D%3D%5C%5Cbegin%7Bbmatrix%7DL_%7B11%7D%5E%7B2%7D%26L_%7B11%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7B2%3A%2C1%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5C%5C%5CL_%7B11%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7B2%3A%2C1%7D%26%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7B2%3A%2C1%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7B2%3A%2C1%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7B2%3A%2C2%3A%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7B2%3A%2C2%3A%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cend%7Bbmatrix%7D%5C%5Ctag%7BA.14%7D%22%7D"></card></p>
<ul>
<li>由此可构造如下线性方程组</li>
</ul>
<p style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-100%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B11%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%3DL_%7B11%7D%5E%7B2%7D%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B2%3A%2C1%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%3DL_%7B11%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7B2%3A%2C1%7D%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B2%3A%2C2%3A%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7B2%3A%2C1%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7B2%3A%2C1%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7B2%3A%2C2%3A%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7B2%3A%2C2%3A%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5C%5Ctag%7BA.15%7D%22%7D"></card></p>
<ul>
<li>求解该方程组，得到</li>
</ul>
<p style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-101%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%5CnL_%7B11%7D%3D%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B11%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%7D%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B0.4em%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7B2%3A%2C1%7D%3D%5C%5Cdfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B11%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B2%3A%2C1%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B0.6em%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7B2%3A%2C2%3A%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7B2%3A%2C2%3A%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B2%3A%2C2%3A%7D%5E%7B-1%7D-%5C%5Cdfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B11%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%7D%7D%5C%5Cdfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B11%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B2%3A%2C1%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B1%2C2%3A%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5C%5Ctag%7BA.16%7D%22%7D"></card></p>
<ul>
<li>回顾 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-102%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B1%3A%2C1%3A%7D%5E%7B-1%7D-%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B11%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B1%3A%2C1%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B1%2C1%3A%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%22%7D"></card>，该式对第一行和第一列执行高斯消元，结果对应 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-103%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B-1%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%22%7D"></card>。式（A.16）的第三个方程实质上对应移除第一行和第一列后的 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-104%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B-1%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%22%7D"></card>，因此有 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-105%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B-1%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7B2%3A%2C2%3A%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7B2%3A%2C2%3A%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%7D"></card>。递归移除当前 Hessian 逆矩阵的第一行和第一列，即得 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-106%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B-q%3A%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7Bq%2B1%3A%2Cq%2B1%3A%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7Bq%2B1%3A%2Cq%2B1%3A%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%7D"></card>，引理得证</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="a3-proof-of-theorem-42">🦉 A.3 Proof Of Theorem 4.2</h2>
<p><strong>定理 4.2：<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-107%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D%22%7D"></card> 满足 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-108%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D%3D%5C%5Cleft((%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D)%5C%5Codot%5C%5Cmathbf%7BM%7D_U%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%7D"></card>，其中 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-109%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BM%7D_U%5C%5Cin%5C%5C%7B0%2C1%5C%5C%7D%5E%7Bn%5C%5Ctimes%20n%7D%22%7D"></card> 为严格上三角掩码，对角线上方全为 1，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-110%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Codot%22%7D"></card> 为逐元素乘法</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>证明</strong>：首先计算矩阵 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-111%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D%22%7D"></card> 的各行，其表达式为</li>
</ul>
<p style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-112%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D_%7Bi%2C%3A%7D%3D%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D_%7Bi%2C%3A%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7Bi%2B1%3A%2Ci%2B1%3A%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7Bi%2B1%3A%2Ci%2B1%3A%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Ctag%7BA.17%7D%22%7D"></card></p>
<ul>
<li>对于矩阵 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-113%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7Bi%2B1%3A%2Ci%2B1%3A%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%7D"></card>，仅当 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-114%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22j%3Ei%22%7D"></card> 时，第 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-115%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22j%22%7D"></card> 列才含有非零元素，因此 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-116%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D%22%7D"></card> 的元素可写为</li>
</ul>
<p style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-117%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D_%7Bi%2Cj%7D%3D%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%5C%5Csum_%7Ba%3Di%2B1%7D%5E%7Bj%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BO%7D_%7Bi%2Ca%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7Ba%2Cj%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%2C%26i%3Cj%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B0.5em%5D%5Cn0%2C%26i%5C%5Cgeq%20j%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5C%5Ctag%7BA.18%7D%22%7D"></card></p>
<!-- The PDF writes Delta X_{i:,} in the following definition; its original index order is retained. -->
<ul>
<li>其中，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-118%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BO%7D_%7Bi%2Ca%7D%3D(%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D_%7Bi%3A%2C%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7Bi%2B1%3A%2Ci%2B1%3A%7D)_a%22%7D"></card> 是前三项乘积中的元素。<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-119%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7Bi%2B1%3A%2Ci%2B1%3A%7D%22%7D"></card> 仅在 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-120%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22a%3Ei%22%7D"></card> 时，第 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-121%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22a%22%7D"></card> 列有非零元素，因此 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-122%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BO%7D%22%7D"></card> 可计算为</li>
</ul>
<p style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-123%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BO%7D_%7Bi%2Ca%7D%3D%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3Da%7D%5E%7Bn%7D(%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D_%7Bi%2C%3A%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D)_b%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7Bb%2Ca%7D%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3Da%7D%5E%7Bn%7D(%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D)_%7Bi%2Cb%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7Bb%2Ca%7D%2C%26i%3Ca%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B0.5em%5D%5Cn0%2C%26i%5C%5Cgeq%20a%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5C%5Ctag%7BA.19%7D%22%7D"></card></p>
<ul>
<li>因此，将 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-124%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D%22%7D"></card> 的下三角区域掩去，即可得到 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-125%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BO%7D%22%7D"></card></li>
</ul>
<p style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-126%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BO%7D%3D(%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D)%5C%5Codot%5C%5Cmathbf%7BM%7D_U%5C%5Ctag%7BA.20%7D%22%7D"></card></p>
<ul>
<li>由于 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-127%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BO%7D%22%7D"></card> 的下三角区域为零，可直接将 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-128%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BO%7D%22%7D"></card> 与 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-129%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%7D"></card> 相乘得到 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-130%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D%22%7D"></card></li>
</ul>
<p style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-131%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BO%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D)_%7Bi%2Cj%7D%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Ba%3D1%7D%5E%7Bj%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BO%7D_%7Bi%2Ca%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7Ba%2Cj%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Ba%3D1%7D%5E%7Bi%7D0%5C%5Ctimes%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7Ba%2Cj%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%2B%5C%5Csum_%7Ba%3Di%2B1%7D%5E%7Bj%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BO%7D_%7Bi%2Ca%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7Ba%2Cj%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%2B%5C%5Csum_%7Ba%3Dj%2B1%7D%5E%7Bn%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BO%7D_%7Bi%2Ca%7D%5C%5Ctimes0%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Ba%3Di%2B1%7D%5E%7Bj%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BO%7D_%7Bi%2Ca%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7Ba%2Cj%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D_%7Bi%2Cj%7D%5C%5Ctag%7BA.21%7D%22%7D"></card></p>
<ul>
<li>因此，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quant-md-132%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D%3D%5C%5Cleft((%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D)%5C%5Codot%5C%5Cmathbf%7BM%7D_U%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%7D"></card>，定理得证</li>
</ul></section>